      },
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "29154948"
      },
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "29381136"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Interacts with COA1 (PubMed:22356826). Found in a complex with TMEM177, COX20, MT-CO2/COX2, COX18, SCO1 and SCO2 (PubMed:29154948). Interacts with MT-CO2/COX2 and SCO2 (PubMed:25959673). Interacts with SCO1 (PubMed:26160915). Interacts with COX20 in a MT-CO2/COX2- and COX18-dependent manner (PubMed:28330871, PubMed:29154948). Interacts with COX16 (PubMed:29381136)"
    }
   ],
